# Input

```svelte
<div><div>asd</div><span>asd</span></div>

<div><span>asd</span><div>asd</div></div>

<div> <div>asd</div> <span>asd</span> </div>

<div> <span>asd</span> <div>asd</div> </div>

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -8,12 +8,6 @@
     <div>asd</div>
 </div>
 
-<div>
-    <div>asd</div>
-    <span>asd</span>
-</div>
+<div><div>asd</div> <span>asd</span> </div>
 
-<div>
-    <span>asd</span>
-    <div>asd</div>
-</div>
+<div> <span>asd</span> <div>asd</div> </div>
```

# Output

```svelte
<div>
    <div>asd</div>
    <span>asd</span>
</div>

<div>
    <span>asd</span>
    <div>asd</div>
</div>

<div><div>asd</div> <span>asd</span> </div>

